[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4883870066","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120943#issuecomment-4883870066","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120943","id":4883870066,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIxnxcg","user":{"login":"Cyklon3000","id":67823272,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODIzMjcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67823272?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000","html_url":"https://github.com/Cyklon3000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-04T21:32:46Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T21:33:32Z","body":"I cant reproduce this on Godot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8157) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-11700 @ 2.50GHz (16 threads) - 31.81 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\nDoes this also apply to the \"Run Current Scene (F6)\" button in the top right of the editor?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4883870066/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4883877129","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120943#issuecomment-4883877129","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120943","id":4883877129,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIxoNCQ","user":{"login":"geekley","id":38332912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MzMyOTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38332912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley","html_url":"https://github.com/geekley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-04T21:35:40Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T21:38:11Z","body":"> Does this also apply to the \"Run Current Scene (F6)\" button in the top right of the editor?\n\nYes, it happens both via clicking the button as well as via F6 shortcut.\n\nI'm on Linux Kubuntu, on KDE Plasma, running Godot via flatpak.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4883877129/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4883902851","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120943#issuecomment-4883902851","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120943","id":4883902851,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIxpxgw","user":{"login":"geekley","id":38332912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MzMyOTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38332912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley","html_url":"https://github.com/geekley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-04T21:45:54Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T21:46:33Z","body":"@Cyklon3000 Oh wow, I just found the issue??\nI was thinking about what's the only thing I did differently from other projects and looking at project.godot, I noticed I enabled this setting for this one:\n```ini\nconfig/disable_project_settings_override=true\n```\nSetting it to false, it worked, so that's the culprit.\n\nI guess it kinda makes sense in a way, but I'd say it's still a bug.\nThe editor should make it work regardless of this setting.\nOr if it's not possible at all, at the very least disable the button and the command so as to not confuse users, to make it clear it's not supported in this case.\n\nBut it should just work IMO, or maybe I gotta add an editor override I guess.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4883902851/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4883917632","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120943#issuecomment-4883917632","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120943","id":4883917632,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIxqrQA","user":{"login":"geekley","id":38332912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MzMyOTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38332912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley","html_url":"https://github.com/geekley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-04T21:52:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T21:53:43Z","body":"Yeah, with an editor override it worked:\n```ini\nconfig/disable_project_settings_override.editor=false\n```\nI think the best solution is to include this override by default, so even if users enable the setting, it won't break editor functionality.\nPreferably add a warning in the setting's tooltip documentation too.\n\nOf course, if it's possible to implement this in a way that would not depend on it, that would be even better; but the solution above might help to not break other editor features passed via override I suppose, if these exist.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4883917632/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4885797272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120943#issuecomment-4885797272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120943","id":4885797272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIzdZmA","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-05T11:13:12Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T11:13:12Z","body":"> Not reproducible in: v4.6.stable.flathub\n\nI can reproduce the issue, but also on 4.6 stable. Could you re-test on 4.6 to confirm?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4885797272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4886418128","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120943#issuecomment-4886418128","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120943","id":4886418128,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI0DS0A","user":{"login":"geekley","id":38332912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MzMyOTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38332912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley","html_url":"https://github.com/geekley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-05T14:40:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T14:40:39Z","body":"@matheusmdx Yeah, sorry I forgot to edit that. Removed it.\nLike I said, turns out the issue wasn't the difference in Godot version, it was the difference in that setting that I had enabled on the fresh 4.7 project but not on the existing 4.6 one. The version is not the cause (sorry if my poor testing was misleading).\n\nAs for tracing it back, I don't know since when it happens (I had never enabled this setting before in my previous projects, I only tried it now in 4.7). I'd assume probably it happens since ever. I assume godot editor probably must have always used project overrides under the hood to implement starting the game in a specific scene.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4886418128/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027751625","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120943#issuecomment-5027751625","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120943","id":5027751625,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK61myQ","user":{"login":"bluebirdsan","id":60063904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDYzOTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60063904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan","html_url":"https://github.com/bluebirdsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T22:07:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T22:07:57Z","body":"I tracked down where the `config/disable_project_settings_override` is checked.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/db01b4f730819cb39bce1922a7ec377b18239c0f/main/main.cpp#L4220-L4245\n\nThis seems intentional, so I don't think this is a bug.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027751625/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027827611","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120943#issuecomment-5027827611","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120943","id":5027827611,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK66Pmw","user":{"login":"geekley","id":38332912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MzMyOTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38332912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley","html_url":"https://github.com/geekley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T22:19:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T22:22:37Z","body":"@bluebirdsan Well I say it's a bug, because:\n1. It's not immediately obvious to the user that a project settings override should be required for an editor feature like running a specific scene. From the user's viewpoint, those are 2 unrelated things. These being related is an implementation detail.\n2. Even if it's intentional that the implementation works through that feature, then it should either clearly warn users the issues with disabling, or better yet, just come with a `.editor` override for that setting explicitly set to `false` by default, so that even when someone enables the main toggle (because they don't want players messing with arbitrary settings in the builds) it still stays disabled in the editor. Then add docs on the override saying why it should stay disabled, like \"on the editor, you should allow overrides so features like running specific scenes work correctly\"","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027827611/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027932051","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120943#issuecomment-5027932051","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120943","id":5027932051,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK7Ankw","user":{"login":"bluebirdsan","id":60063904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDYzOTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60063904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan","html_url":"https://github.com/bluebirdsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T22:35:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T22:35:39Z","body":"1. I agree on this. These two shouldn't affect each other.\n2. It would probably be even better if the behavior of \"Run Current Scene\" wouldn't be affected by a setting. I can't think of a reason, where when you \"Run Current Scene\" you'd want it not to do that (defeats the purpose of the button).\n\nI also checked your `config/disable_project_settings_override.editor=false` and couldn't find it anywhere in the code (with the `.editor` part). Am I missing something?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027932051/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5028006694","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120943#issuecomment-5028006694","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120943","id":5028006694,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK7FLJg","user":{"login":"geekley","id":38332912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MzMyOTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38332912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley","html_url":"https://github.com/geekley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geekley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T22:47:44Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T22:47:44Z","body":"@bluebirdsan\n> I also checked your `config/disable_project_settings_override.editor=false` and couldn't find it anywhere in the code (with the `.editor` part). Am I missing something?\n\nWhat I meant with that code is that you can add it to project.godot so as to avoid the bug. So, if you add that platform-specific override for the editor in your project's settings, so as to force that setting disabled on the editor, then you can even leave it enabled in exported builds without it interfering with normal editor usage.\n\nSo a simple fix would be to include that editor-specific value by default in project settings, so users know not to mess with it directly, while still being able to change the main value.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5028006694/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]